From b3b4f00adfb5a387509330b86b4f91a2be76c315 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michel JAOUEN <michel.jaouen@st.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Oct 2025 11:12:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 832/913] module: scmi_system_power: fix graceful in system
 power state notifier

The api scmi_sys_power_state_notify has a boolean to indicate forceful.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 67d41ce43af5ae500bb435746fcef1f73b867c87 module: scmi_system_power: fix graceful in system power state notifier]
Change-Id: Icc12b1bea063dc874b7e165899a6d8fa9b77f5d6
Signed-off-by: Michel JAOUEN <michel.jaouen@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/SCP-firmware/+/584007
Reviewed-by: Valentin CARON <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Valentin CARON <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Tested-by: Valentin CARON <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 .../module/scmi_system_power/src/mod_scmi_system_power.c        | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/scmi_system_power/src/mod_scmi_system_power.c b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/scmi_system_power/src/mod_scmi_system_power.c
index d1a5b125d..db708af40 100644
--- a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/scmi_system_power/src/mod_scmi_system_power.c
+++ b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/scmi_system_power/src/mod_scmi_system_power.c
@@ -492,7 +492,7 @@ static int scmi_sys_power_state_set_handler(fwk_id_t service_id,
             scmi_sys_power_state_notify(
                 service_id,
                 mod_scmi_system_state,
-                (parameters->flags & STATE_SET_FLAGS_GRACEFUL_REQUEST) != 0);
+                (parameters->flags & STATE_SET_FLAGS_GRACEFUL_REQUEST) == 0);
         }
     }
 #endif
